## **7. ARQUIVOS DE CONFIGURAÇÃO ADICIONAIS**

### **`.gitignore`**
```gitignore
# Terraform
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
.terraform.lock.hcl

# Kubernetes
kubeconfig
*.kubeconfig

# Editor
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Secrets
secrets.auto.tfvars
*.pem
*.key
*.crt

# Local scripts
scripts/.env